DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45726::$$$message_0437_0000_0000$$$::"Hm."::
45727::$$$message_0437_0000_0001$$$::"Oh?"::
45728::$$$message_0437_0000_0002$$$::"Someone you know, big man?"::
45729::$$$message_0437_0000_0003$$$::"No. He appears to be a mage."::
45730::$$$message_0437_0000_0004$$$::"I've found you, the corrupt Master and Servant who keep breaking mage rules!"::
45731::$$$message_0437_0000_0005$$$::"I, the ninth head of the Archibald line, known otherwise as "Big Ben" Kayneth El-Melloi, will..."::
45732::$$$message_0437_0000_0006$$$::"...deliver![wvl canskip=false time=200] Your Capital![wvl canskip=false time=200] Punishment!::
45733::$$$message_0437_0000_0007$$$::(Has anyone ever called him Big Ben...?)::
45734::$$$message_0437_0000_0008$$$::(Heh. Nailed it.)::
45735::$$$message_0437_0000_0009$$$::"(stare)"::
45736::$$$message_0437_0000_0010$$$::"Hm?"::
45737::$$$message_0437_0000_0011$$$::"(stare)..."::
45738::$$$message_0437_0000_0012$$$::"W-what?"::
45739::$$$message_0437_0000_0013$$$::"Oh, sorry. I was wondering about the ingredients."::
45740::$$$message_0437_0000_0014$$$::"Uh, ingredients?"::
45741::$$$message_0437_0000_0015$$$::"The material is flexible, so it may be best wrapped around an inner skeleton."::
45742::$$$message_0437_0000_0016$$$::"Looks like he has a lot of blubber, too."::
45743::$$$message_0437_0000_0017$$$::"You're talking about me!?"::
45744::$$$message_0437_0000_0018$$$::"Stand back, Lady Sola-Ui! Caster and his Master are savage fiends who have done unspeakable things to children!"::
45745::$$$message_0437_0000_0019$$$::"If something were to happen to you, Lord Kayneth would weep!"::
45746::$$$message_0437_0000_0020$$$::"Lancer...[heart]"::
45747::$$$message_0437_0000_0021$$$::"...I said [font italic=true]Lord Kayneth[font italic=false] would weep!"::
45748::$$$message_0437_0000_0022$$$::"Hehehe. Thank you, Lancer. You're risking your life for me! [font italic=true]For me![font italic=false]"::
45749::$$$message_0437_0000_0023$$$::[delay speed=25]"For my lord! [delay speed=user][wvl]I will lay down everything if I must... [wait canskip=false time=40]bo[wait canskip=false time=40]d[wait canskip=false time=40]y[wait canskip=false time=40] and[wait canskip=false time=40] so[wait canskip=false time=40]ul[hfangry layer=0]!::
45750::$$$message_0437_0000_0024$$$::"...Sounds like things are pretty complicated for them."::
45751::$$$message_0437_0000_0025$$$::"I must say, I'm not too fond of such depraved relationships."::
45752::$$$message_0437_0000_0026$$$::"...Ah![wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=ケイネス face=怒3 pos=right time=300 twno=1][hfangry layer=1] What are you doing, Lancer!? Hurry up and dispose of this Servant!"::
45753::$$$message_0437_0000_0027$$$::"By your will!"::
45754::$$$message_0437_0000_0028$$$::"Good luck, Lancer!"::
45755::$$$message_0437_0000_0029$$$::"..."::
45756::$$$message_0437_0000_0030$$$::"Let's begin, Caster!"::
45757::$$$message_0437_0000_0031$$$::"Now, Ryunosuke, or whatever your name was. I, Kayneth El-Melloi Archibald, will deliver the justice you deserve!"::
45758::$$$message_0437_0000_0032$$$::"You will know the consequences for eyeing my fiancée with lusty eyes!"::
45759::$$$message_0437_0000_0033$$$::"...I wasn't ogling her, though."::
45760::$$$message_0437_0000_0034$$$::"If anything, it was more like covetous eyes."::
�